# Cloudflare Pages routing for EdgeDesk.
#
# Routing split:
#   - Everything except /api/* is served from this static Vite bundle (SPA fallback).
#   - /api/* is proxied to the edgedesk-api Worker, which is the only backend.
#
# The Worker URL below is a placeholder for a real deployment. Replace
# <your-subdomain> with the account's workers.dev subdomain (or a custom route).
# Locally, packages/web/vite.config.ts performs the same proxy to 127.0.0.1:8787,
# so no _redirects rule is used during dev, preview, tests, or benchmarks.

/* /index.html 200
/api/* https://edgedesk-api.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev/api/:splat 200
